# Code is LF in every checkout, Windows included: a CRLF checkout (git's Windows default, core.autocrlf=true) made
# vitest fail to import the sonni/*.mjs scripts on the owner's PC (report local-win n°04).
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
